message: If you use this work, please cite the paper.
title: Bi-temporal Image-driven Acute Stroke Evolution Analysis
abstract: >-
  A bi-temporal tissue phenotyping framework linking admission CT perfusion
  signatures to follow-up DWI-defined tissue outcome through six outcome-aware
  region-of-interest classes, with statistical, radiomic and deep-learning
  feature families.
